<p>shaheed se koi shamsheer ka mazaa pooche<br />
mareez se koi akseer ka mazaa pooche<br />
aseer se koi zanjeer ka mazaa pooche<br />
yateem se koi dilgeer ka mazaa pooche</p>

<p>har ek pa guzra zamane me ranj-o- gham hai hai<br />
sahaa na aabid-e- beemar sa alam hai hai<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>shaheed hote huwe baap ko pisar dekhe<br />
ani pa naize ki hai hai sar-e- pidar dekhe<br />
jawaan bhaai ka nikla huwa jigar dekhe<br />
phupi ko aankho'n se balwe me nange sar dekhe</p>

<p>kisi nabi pe na is tarha ke alam guzre<br />
jo is mareez pa har tarha ke sitam guzre<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>shadeed tap me wo kaanto'n pa chalna aabid kaa<br />
pahan ke bediyaa'n har ek qadam pa gir padnaa<br />
wo zulm-o- jor-e- sitamgar haram ka shor-e-bukaa<br />
wo jisme-laaghare aabid wo dhoop wo durra</p>

<p>siwaaye shukre quda kuch na kehte the sajjad<br />
duaa-e- ummat-e- aasi me rehte the sajjad<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>phiraaya kaanto'n pa sajjad ko barahnaa paa<br />
nabi ke kunbe ko balwe me le gaye aadaa<br />
jalaaya qaima-e- naamoose syed-e- waala<br />
phiraake balwe me zindaa'n me qaid kardaala</p>

<p>tamaasha dekhne sab ehle shaam aate the<br />
hayaa se ahle haram gardan-e jhukaate the<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>sitam ke baad huwa qaid se jo chutkaara<br />
laee'n se baap ka sar is yateem ne maanga<br />
sare hussain qazaane se hind ne bheja<br />
sawaar oonto'n pa kunba huwa payambar ka</p>

<p>lahad me laash gharibo'n ki haaye dharne chale<br />
mah-e- butool ko paivand-e- qaak karne chale<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>jo pahonche karbobala aabide aseere balaa<br />
pidar ko deke kafan qaak me rakha laasha<br />
lipat ke qabr se chillaaye yu ke aye baba<br />
watan ko jaata hoo'n lo aaqri mera mujraa</p>

<p>watan se aaya tha kis shaan se yahaa hai hai<br />
lutaa ke ghar ko mai jaata hoo'n neem jaa'n hai hai<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>likha hai yu ke watan aaye jab shah-e-waala<br />
pidar ki yaad me har waqt karte the naala<br />
nazar jo aata tha paani to rote the moula<br />
hamesha aankho'n me phirta tha dasht-e- karbobala</p>

<p>pidar ke baad bhi raahat mili na aabid ko<br />
dobaara qaid kiya is ghareeb zaahed ko<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>watan se legaye phir qaid karke baaniye shar<br />
huwi bhatije ke hamraah zainab-e- muztar<br />
qareeb shaam jo pohnche wo dono nouhagar<br />
lagaaya belcha zainab ki pusht ke oopar</p>

<p>safar me zainab-e- bekas se chut gaye sajjad<br />
dayaar-e- shaam me phir aake lut gaye sajjad<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>phupi ko sounp ke jangal me syed-e- waala<br />
madine me huwa daaqil wo bekas-o- tanha<br />
waleed-e- shaam ke haakim ne zaher bhijwaaya<br />
wo sam ke khaate hi aabid ne ki jahaa'n se qazaa</p>

<p>falak pa hoor-o- malak arsh ko hilaane lage<br />
zamee'n pa jinn-o- bashar sar pa qaak udaane lage<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>mohibbo daaghe alam dil pa dhar gaye sajjad<br />
jo khaya zaher to sad haif margaye sajjad<br />
nabi ki aal ko be aas kargaye sajjad<br />
yateem hogaye baaqir guzar gaye sajjad</p>

<p>sar apna peet'te marqad se mustafa nikle<br />
kaleja thaamke kyu kar na faatema nikle<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>charaaghe deen-e- nabi aaj bujh gaya yaa rab<br />
nishaan-e- panjetan-e- paak mitgaya yaa rab<br />
uthaa jahaan se sartaaj ab mera yaa rab<br />
qitaab bewa-e- aabid mujhe mila yaa rab</p>

<p>karu mai kya meri qismat bigad gayi yaa rab<br />
chaman me faatema ke ous padh gayi yaa rab<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>quda ke arsh ka taara guzar gaya logo<br />
ghazab hai shaah hamaara guzar gaya logo<br />
wo bekaso'n ka sahaara guzar gaya logo<br />
hassan hussain ka pyaara guzar gaya logo</p>

<p>madina lut gaya ya mustafa duhaayi hai<br />
najaf ujad gaya ya murtaza duhaayi hai<br />
____________________________<br />
</p>